<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hate You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3Q6F3Xru9U0tb7n57zNiAT</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.140" end="00:06.200">You missed the exit sign</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.200" end="00:12.940">It's all falling apart now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.940" end="00:16.420">'Cause we were doing fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.420" end="00:23.870">Until you messed it up now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.870" end="00:31.870">One day the world you knew will all come crashing down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.210" end="00:34.710">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.530" end="00:36.030">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.830" end="00:38.730">Let's set fire to the streets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.730" end="00:41.110">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.110" end="00:43.240" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(We ain't going nowhere)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.240" end="00:44.740">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.580" end="00:46.100">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.100" end="00:51.580">And we ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.580" end="00:59.580">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.780" end="01:07.250">I'm sick of dead machines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.250" end="01:13.940">Telling me how to feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.940" end="01:17.800">I want my slate clean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.800" end="01:24.540">And my people real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.540" end="01:32.540">One day the world you knew will all come crashing down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.910" end="01:35.410">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.190" end="01:36.690">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.650" end="01:39.520">Let's set fire to the streets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.520" end="01:42.020">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.020" end="01:44.040" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(We ain't going nowhere)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.040" end="01:45.580">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.580" end="01:47.080">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.740" end="01:52.280">And we ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.280" end="01:54.540">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.540" end="01:59.340">There's a fire in the park and you're all invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.340" end="02:01.790">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.790" end="02:04.490">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.490" end="02:09.450">There's a fire in the park and you're all invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.450" end="02:11.940">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.940" end="02:19.940">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.410" end="02:25.910">I've got nothing to lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.730" end="02:27.230">And I hate you too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.970" end="02:28.470">The way that you dress</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.850" end="02:29.350">And the things that you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.260" end="02:30.760">The smile on your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.400" end="02:32.060">The smell of this place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.060" end="02:33.900">I fucking hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.900" end="02:39.790">I fucking hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.790" end="02:41.290">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.860" end="02:42.360">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.280" end="02:44.670">Let's set fire to the streets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.670" end="02:47.420">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.420" end="02:49.820" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(We ain't going nowhere)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.820" end="02:51.320">I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.070" end="02:52.570">You hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.360" end="02:57.640">And we ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.640" end="02:59.660">We ain't going nowhere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.660" end="03:05.110">There's a fire in the park and you're all invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.110" end="03:07.460">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.460" end="03:10.180">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.180" end="03:15.160">There's a fire in the park and you're all invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.160" end="03:17.450">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.450" end="03:22.230">So come along</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.230" end="03:26.230" /></div></body></tt>